WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.064 --> 00:00:02.280
- We are almost outta time,

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:04.320
but I have one more
important story to share.

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:05.695
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.695 --> 00:00:06.612
(upbeat music)

00:00:06.612 --> 00:00:08.430
(audience cheers)

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:09.450
So as you know,

00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:10.283
this is the part

00:00:10.283 --> 00:00:11.116
of the show

00:00:11.116 --> 00:00:12.120
where I usually surprise someone

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:13.050
with a thousand dollars,

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:15.030
courtesy of our friends at Pilot Pen.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:17.760
Typically, it's a guest from
a post I found on social,

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:18.930
but sometimes,

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:21.030
I get to surprise a member of the audience

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:22.755
like this moment from a few weeks ago.

00:00:22.755 --> 00:00:23.588
(swooshing sound)

00:00:23.588 --> 00:00:24.421
Who's got it?

00:00:24.421 --> 00:00:25.640
Who's going shopping, y'all?

00:00:26.534 --> 00:00:27.780
(audience cheers)

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:29.640
How do you think you're
gonna spend that money?

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:30.600
- Concert tickets!

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.430
- Yeah!
(audience cheers)

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:33.927
what a great answer.

00:00:33.927 --> 00:00:35.850
- And I've never seen you in concert,

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:37.650
so maybe if there's a show sometime

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:38.610
down the road, maybe...
- I don't know,

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:40.357
maybe there might be one coming up.

00:00:40.357 --> 00:00:41.220
I dunno,
(audience groans)

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:42.990
I can't say it,
- [Lily] That's who I'd see.

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:44.220
- but you might be able to use it.

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:45.364
I'm gonna plan for that.

00:00:45.364 --> 00:00:47.758
(audience cheers)
(Lily laughs)

00:00:47.758 --> 00:00:48.900
- So, that was Lily.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:51.540
And what I couldn't tell her at the time

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:53.430
was something, I'm so excited,

00:00:53.430 --> 00:00:55.740
and have been waiting to announce, today.

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:57.690
So I asked her to dial us in.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:58.840
So what's up Lily?

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:00.536
(audience cheers)

00:01:00.536 --> 00:01:01.369
- Hi.

00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:03.930
- Hi! So have you
- How's it going?

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:05.010
- It's going well.

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:06.630
So have you spent the money yet?

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:08.190
- Not yet.

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:09.180
As as you know,

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:11.280
I'd prefer to spend it on concert tickets.

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:14.160
So, I've got a few in
my head right now and,

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:14.993
like you said,

00:01:14.993 --> 00:01:17.730
I feel like there might be
something coming with you,

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:18.780
so...

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:21.000
- Oh, that's so interesting.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.120
So you are literally one of the first,

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:24.953
to know this.

00:01:24.953 --> 00:01:26.190
I'm going to be playing

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:28.170
an exclusive Las Vegas engagement

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:29.192
this July 28th
(audience cheers)

00:01:29.192 --> 00:01:32.098
through August 19th at Bakkt Theater,

00:01:32.098 --> 00:01:34.226
Planet Hollywood.

00:01:34.226 --> 00:01:35.476
I'm only doing,

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:37.860
10 shows.

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:39.840
I could only commit to 10 shows.

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:40.980
That's why it's exclusive.

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:42.270
There's only 10 shows.

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:43.103
I ain't addin' more.

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:44.280
I'm telling you right now,

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:46.500
Mama needs a little bit
of minute of a break.

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:48.570
So "Chemistry, an Intimate Evening"

00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:51.150
is something you can only see in Vegas.

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:52.320
It's just for this show.

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:53.370
Just for these 10 shows.

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:55.170
And tickets go on sale this Friday

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:58.020
at TicketMaster.com/KellyVegas.

00:01:58.020 --> 00:02:00.180
So Lily, here is the cool news.

00:02:00.180 --> 00:02:01.110
I hope it's cool for you.

00:02:01.110 --> 00:02:02.820
If it's not, just pretend.

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:04.680
Not only are you going to get to see

00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:06.360
my brand new Las Vegas engagement,

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:08.220
you won't have to spend
a dime of that money

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:09.053
that you got here

00:02:09.053 --> 00:02:10.230
because we are hooking you up

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:11.745
with two tickets to the show,

00:02:11.745 --> 00:02:12.578
(audience applauds)

00:02:12.578 --> 00:02:13.957
a two-night hotel stay

00:02:13.957 --> 00:02:15.868
at Planet Hollywood Resort &amp; Casino,

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:19.590
and round-trip flights
for you and a guest.

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:21.633
So you're comin' in style, Lily!

00:02:22.475 --> 00:02:23.735
- Thank ya!

00:02:23.735 --> 00:02:24.780
I'm gonna take my mom!

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:25.860
She's never been to Vegas.

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:26.820
- Oh! Yes!

00:02:26.820 --> 00:02:27.653
Bring your mom!

00:02:27.653 --> 00:02:28.830
I'm gonna bring my mama too

00:02:28.830 --> 00:02:30.167
I'm gonna make her have
a little drink too.

00:02:30.167 --> 00:02:31.000
- [Lily] Oh, yeah!
- Okay.

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.231
Thank you so much, Lily.

00:02:32.231 --> 00:02:33.889
We're liking your post right now.

00:02:33.889 --> 00:02:35.768
(audience applauds)

00:02:35.768 --> 00:02:36.601
(bell dings)

00:02:36.601 --> 00:02:37.434
- And that's not all,

00:02:37.434 --> 00:02:38.520
our season long partner,

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:40.020
Pilot Pen, Makers of Friction,

00:02:40.020 --> 00:02:40.920
the go to erasable pen

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:41.940
of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:45.510
want you to attend even more
concerts this year, Lily.

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:48.260
So they're giving you an
additional thousand dollars.

00:02:48.260 --> 00:02:50.359
(audience cheers)

00:02:50.359 --> 00:02:51.390
You get a thousand
- What?

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:52.440
- [Kelly] more dollars.

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:53.273
- Gawd!

00:02:53.273 --> 00:02:54.106
- Yeah, Lily!

00:02:55.293 --> 00:02:56.670
Enjoy that money, girl!

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:58.020
Go see some shows!

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.670
Thank you to all our guests this hour,

00:02:59.670 --> 00:03:02.577
Jeff Goldblum, Chase
Stokes, Megan Piphus Peace,

00:03:02.577 --> 00:03:05.100
and the Mildred Snitzer Orchestra.

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:06.480
Y'all have a great day, if it's not,

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:07.890
